	<row id="msg_0383_R33_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huff, huff... I FINALLY got through\nthat cave.\rIt was WAY bigger than the brochure\nsaid. There ain’t even a brochure.\fI made it up. I’m delirious.</language>
